 "notes": [
  "test_stokes_mtmfs_IQUV.1+2 is refused by usemask='pb' (#1061), as before.",
  "mtmfs_polarized.point_IV passes every product but tst.model.tt1, NRMS 1.0 between two planes of rounding: refim_point_linRL's point is flat, so the tt1 model is 8e-23 and 5e-22 Jy in casa-rs and 3.6e-8 and 2.7e-8 Jy in CASA against a tt0 model of 0.27 and 2.6 Jy. In IQUV the same planes pass because Q's and U's tt1 models are not zero.",
  "mtmfs_polarized.mosaic_IQUV failed in casa-rs with 'the multi-term Hessian is not invertible': refim_mawproject.ms has RR and LL only, and the mosaic route leaves Q's and U's Taylor PSF moments zero where CASA gives every plane the first correlation's. After this round the availability gate refuses Stokes planes other than I alone with the mosaic, W- and AW-projection gridders, naming #1112."
 ],
